===Adjective===
{{en-adj|er|more}}

# Likely to [[bend]] or [[break]] under [[pressure]]; [[weak]], [[shaky]], [[flexible]], or [[fragile]].
#: ''He expected the '''flimsy''' structure to collapse at any moment.''
#* Sheridan
#*: All the '''flimsy''' furniture of a country miss's brain.

